# Daquila_FranzRobert_HypotenuseProgram (Hypotenuse Calculating Program)

## Description
The program computes the length of a triangle's hypotenuse when given the other two sides' lengths.

## How to Run
1. Open the program in PyCharm.
2. Run the program.
3. Enter the values for a and b
4. Check the length of the hypotenuse displayed on the screen.

## Input Needed
- a
- b

## Sample Output
Enter a: 6
Enter b: 8
The hypotenuse's length is 10 units.

